        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s3_1",
            "speaker": "WOMAN",
            "text": "That sounds interesting. It makes a change from children and parents, doesn't it!",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_2",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "Exactly. Because the art college is in use for classes, throughout the festival, the videos are being shown in Handsworth House.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_3",
            "speaker": "WOMAN",
            "text": "How do you spell the name?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_4",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "H-A-N-D-S-W-O-R-T-H. Handsworth House. It's close to the Town Hall.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_5",
            "speaker": "WOMAN",
            "text": "Right.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_6",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "Now let me see, what else can I tell you about?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_7",
            "speaker": "WOMAN",
            "text": "Are there any displays of ballet dancing? I'm particularly interested in that as I do it as a hobby.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_8",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "There isn't any ballet, I'm afraid, but there'll be a demonstration of traditional dances from all round the country.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_9",
            "speaker": "WOMAN",
            "text": "Oh, that'd be nice. Where's that being held?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_10",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "It's in the market in the town centre - the outdoor one, not the covered market. And it's on at 2 and 5 every afternoon of the festival, apart from the first day.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
